  }, {
    "tStartMs": 629820,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so there's a mix of just\nwanting it to be the case"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 633720,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the, like, the human understands that"
