  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646260,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because the model kinda\nhas a conception of that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 648180,
    "dDurationMs": 1586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's like, it doesn't have to,"
