  }, {
    "tStartMs": 680313,
    "dDurationMs": 1664,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Stuart] Okay, that's the system prompt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 681977,
    "dDurationMs": 2713,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But let's take a step back\nto the fine tuning process"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684690,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and start talking about\nClaude's character."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 687120,
    "dDurationMs": 4710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So this isn't just play acting,\nwhere you might ask a model."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 691830,
    "dDurationMs": 2524,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if I prompt a model and I say,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 694354,
    "dDurationMs": 3386,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Can you please respond in the style of,"
