  }, {
    "tStartMs": 792990,
    "dDurationMs": 1449,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with its, like, fine tuning training."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 794439,
    "dDurationMs": 4119,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it's much harder than, say, just like"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 798558,
    "dDurationMs": 2832,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "not instructing it to\nplay act like, you know."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 801390,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So it's a kind of, it's\ndeeper in the model."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 807060,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Stuart] It's a general\ntendency to behave,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 808290,
    "dDurationMs": 2130,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that is how psychologists"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 810420,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "think about personality, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 811320,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They think about personality as being"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 812580,
    "dDurationMs": 3960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these kind of broad\ntendencies of how to behave."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 816540,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Obviously some people are, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 819000,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sometimes they feel outgoing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 820830,
    "dDurationMs": 1920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and sometimes they feel a\nlittle bit more, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 822750,
    "dDurationMs": 1894,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like they just want to sit on their own."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 824644,
    "dDurationMs": 2668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But on average, someone who's extroverted"
