  }, {
    "tStartMs": 854033,
    "dDurationMs": 1345,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And they're much more specific."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 855378,
    "dDurationMs": 3642,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Can we talk about a couple\nof examples of them?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 859020,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Amanda] Yeah, so I guess I\nthink that there's also maybe,"
