  }, {
    "tStartMs": 901180,
    "dDurationMs": 1162,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Geez, I've said the wrong thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 902342,
    "dDurationMs": 1213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Carry on."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 903555,
    "dDurationMs": 1003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Amanda] Yeah, so I guess, like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 904558,
    "dDurationMs": 2912,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I mean, honestly it kind of relates to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 907470,
    "dDurationMs": 3840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how people have thought about\nethics in models as well,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 911310,
    "dDurationMs": 4170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think, where there's a\nthing where you could think"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 915480,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that for a model to be good"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 917340,
    "dDurationMs": 3099,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is just for it to avoid\ndoing, like, harmful things."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 920439,
    "dDurationMs": 3579,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But I think that when it\ncomes to, say, people,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 924018,
    "dDurationMs": 2712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's this, like,\nricher notion of goodness,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 926730,
    "dDurationMs": 1832,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which is the idea of being a good person"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 928562,
    "dDurationMs": 1648,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in like, a very broad sense."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 930210,
    "dDurationMs": 1260,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And I think that's, like, captured"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 931470,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in this notion of character."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 933120,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So in order to be, like, a good person"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 935400,
    "dDurationMs": 1080,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in this, like, richer sense,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 936480,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's not enough that I\njust, like, go about my day"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 938370,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I avoid, like, doing harm to people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 940260,
    "dDurationMs": 1461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and I'm helpful to people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 941721,
    "dDurationMs": 3099,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like, to be a good kind of friend,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 944820,
    "dDurationMs": 3090,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I have to balance a lot of\ndifferent considerations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 947910,
    "dDurationMs": 2070,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if my friend comes\nto me and asks for like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 949980,
    "dDurationMs": 2254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, advice on medicine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 952234,
    "dDurationMs": 3332,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "knowing that what they might\nwant is, like, some comfort,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 955566,
    "dDurationMs": 3564,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what I can't provide to\nthem is, like, expertise,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 959130,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "thinking about like their wellbeing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 960930,
    "dDurationMs": 1230,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and what they need in the moment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 962160,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So not just thinking, like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 963120,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what will make them like me right now,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 964680,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but thinking, like, what\nis good for my friends?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 966660,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like, what's actually going to help them?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 968100,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Stuart] So this relates\nto the work that Anthropic"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 970740,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you have done on sycophancy, right?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 974100,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That models are sometimes\nsycophantic to people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 977160,
    "dDurationMs": 2760,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they just say things\nthat sort of flatter them"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 979920,
    "dDurationMs": 2430,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or try and get them to, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 982350,
    "dDurationMs": 2640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "tell 'em what they want to hear"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 984990,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rather than actually the response"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 987180,
    "dDurationMs": 3360,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that they might really want or really need"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 990540,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in that particular circumstance."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 992010,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Amanda] Yeah, I think\nthat many good characters,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 994410,
    "dDurationMs": 2106,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "people of good character\nare often likable,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 996516,
    "dDurationMs": 2634,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but being likable does not mean"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 999150,
    "dDurationMs": 1075,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you're of good character."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1000225,
    "dDurationMs": 3725,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so, like, being a\ngood friend, for example,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1003950,
    "dDurationMs": 1470,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "can mean like, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1005420,
    "dDurationMs": 2180,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "giving harsh truths to your friends."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1007600,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if we look back on, like,\nsome great friends we've had,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1011180,
    "dDurationMs": 1237,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think a lot of the time we're not like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1012417,
    "dDurationMs": 1645,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"Oh yeah, my friend\nflatters me all the time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1014062,
    "dDurationMs": 1666,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They basically do what I tell them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1015728,
    "dDurationMs": 2892,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is why like, they're\nsuch a great friend.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1018620,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think we're often like,\n\"Yeah, like, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1020120,
    "dDurationMs": 2550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I came to my friend with a\nview and they pushed back on me"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1022670,
    "dDurationMs": 1265,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because I was actually wrong,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1023935,
    "dDurationMs": 3205,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and in the long term I'm really\nglad that they did that.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1027140,
    "dDurationMs": 1440,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Stuart] Right, it was\nlike an authentic interaction"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1028580,
    "dDurationMs": 900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rather than a fake person."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1029480,
    "dDurationMs": 1084,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Amanda] Yeah, exactly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1030564,
    "dDurationMs": 1661,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Stuart] Just like a yes man or woman."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1032225,
    "dDurationMs": 1002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Amanda] Exactly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1033227,
    "dDurationMs": 1563,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Stuart] Like a yes person, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1034790,
    "dDurationMs": 981,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Amanda] Yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1035771,
    "dDurationMs": 1809,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And like, a person of\ngood character, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1037580,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it depends on the\nsituation that they're in,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1039260,
    "dDurationMs": 2160,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but like, we generally\nthink that they have to be,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1041420,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you know, like, thoughtful and genuine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1043610,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there's just like a kind of richness"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1045410,
    "dDurationMs": 1410,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that goes into that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1046820,
    "dDurationMs": 2155,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in many ways, like\nAI models are in this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1048975,
    "dDurationMs": 3605,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "honestly kind of like strange\nposition as as characters,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1052580,
    "dDurationMs": 3720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because one way I've thought\nabout it is, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1056300,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they have to kind of interact with people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1059000,
    "dDurationMs": 3300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from all over the world,\nwith all different values"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1062300,
    "dDurationMs": 1650,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from all different walks of life."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1063950,
    "dDurationMs": 1890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And many of us don't need to do that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1065840,
    "dDurationMs": 1350,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And there's this interesting question of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1067190,
    "dDurationMs": 3870,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what are the kind of traits\nthat such an entity has to have?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1071060,
    "dDurationMs": 2310,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Stuart] Like a global citizen."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1073370,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Amanda] Yeah, and a\nkind of like, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1075050,
    "dDurationMs": 2773,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, one thing you might\nimagine is something akin to"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1077823,
    "dDurationMs": 3227,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a kind of, I think there's some people"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1081050,
    "dDurationMs": 1299,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who can, like, travel around the world"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1082349,
    "dDurationMs": 3471,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and be kind of like, well-regarded"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1085820,
    "dDurationMs": 2869,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by many of the people that they encounter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1088689,
    "dDurationMs": 3401,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And such a person isn't, again,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1092090,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like, isn't a flatterer necessarily."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1093680,
    "dDurationMs": 1590,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like when I picture\nthis person in my head,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1095270,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I don't picture something\nlike, ah, they just like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1097730,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they adopt the local values and\npretend that they have them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1100190,
    "dDurationMs": 2190,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in fact that can be like\nkind of offensive to people."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1102380,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I think that, like, a person\nwho's in that situation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1105350,
    "dDurationMs": 1560,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "often is actually, like, quite authentic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1106910,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But they're also like,\nopen-minded and thoughtful"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1109610,
    "dDurationMs": 2700,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they engage in discussion\nand they politely disagree,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1112310,
    "dDurationMs": 2122,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and like yeah, these kind of traits"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1114432,
    "dDurationMs": 2468,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that feel necessary in that circumstance,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1116900,
    "dDurationMs": 1680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they're just like, they're rich,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1118580,
    "dDurationMs": 1830,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they're much richer than like, oh,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1120410,
    "dDurationMs": 5000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just like avoid saying anything\nharmful and be sycophantic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1125750,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Those are like not, yeah."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1126583,
    "dDurationMs": 2437,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- [Stuart] It's a tricky\nbalance because, I mean,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1129020,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can see how much literature\nand comedy and everything"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1132590,
    "dDurationMs": 1140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's all about that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1133730,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's all about like people\nin different circumstances"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1136880,
    "dDurationMs": 3150,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than they're normally in,\ntrying to fit in and failing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1140030,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you know, it's all about\nreally what those traits are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1143090,
    "dDurationMs": 1980,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that makes someone fit in and\nwhat makes them not fit in."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1145070,
    "dDurationMs": 2280,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And so yeah, this is a really\ninteresting question of like,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1147350,
    "dDurationMs": 2520,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "how do you, what traits\ndo you give to the model"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1149870,
    "dDurationMs": 833,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in order to make it do that?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1150703,
    "dDurationMs": 2287,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So let's actually talk about specifically"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1152990,
    "dDurationMs": 990,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some of the traits that were given."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1153980,
    "dDurationMs": 1290,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I've got a couple here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1155270,
    "dDurationMs": 3510,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You mentioned, earlier on\nyou mentioned about charity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1158780,
    "dDurationMs": 2707,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "I try, one of the traits that\nyou've given the model is,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1161487,
    "dDurationMs": 3023,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "\"I try to interpret all\nqueries charitably.\""
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1164510,
    "dDurationMs": 3240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Now what does that mean\nin terms of, you know,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1167750,
    "dDurationMs": 3644,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if I type something into the the prompt,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1171394,
    "dDurationMs": 2596,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what would interpreting\nit charitably mean?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1173990,
